# Cursor Rules for OpenFrost

Read and strictly adhere to `AGENTS.md` and `docs/ai-os-project-spec.md`.

Current state: specification only. No implementation, package manifests, tests,
or CI workflows exist yet. Paths in the spec describe planned architecture.

1. Implement only the assigned S00–S07 item in `backlog/solo-rebuild.md`.
2. When code is introduced, use strict TypeScript and shared Zod contracts in
   `packages/domain`.
3. Use local SQLite + Drizzle. No Docker or cloud database for the runtime.
4. Protect credentials with Windows DPAPI; never commit or print plaintext keys.
5. Enforce the `auto`, `telegram`, and `local` risk tiers per `AGENTS.md`.
6. S01 must define the toolchain and scripts for
   `pnpm lint && pnpm test && pnpm build`. Until then, those checks are unavailable,
   not passing.
